      "date": "2026-05-28T04:27:37.000Z",
      "title": "INDIAMART: Rich Valuation Will Remain Vulnerable Despite Higher Revenue Assumptions",
      "body": "Analysts have kept their fair value estimate for IndiaMART InterMESH steady at ₹1,810, with only minor tweaks to the discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E assumptions informing this unchanged price target. What's in the News A board meeting is scheduled for April 30, 2026 to review the audited standalone and consolidated financial results for the quarter and financial year ended March 31, 2026, and to consider a dividend recommendation on equity shares, subject to shareholder approval in the upcoming AGM (Key Developments).",
