      "title": "INDIAMART: Slower Revenue Outlook And Higher Discount Rate Will Pressure Prospects",
      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their price target on IndiaMART InterMESH from ₹1,975 to ₹1,810, reflecting updated assumptions for revenue growth, profit margins, the discount rate, and future P/E expectations. What's in the News A board meeting is scheduled for April 30, 2026 to consider audited standalone and consolidated financial results for the quarter and year ended March 31, 2026 (Key Developments).",
